# NVIDIA NIM API key — used by the serverless proxy at /api/nvidia.js.
#
# IMPORTANT: this is a SERVER-side env var. There is NO `VITE_` prefix here.
# - Vite reads `VITE_*` vars and inlines them into the client JS bundle.
# - The proxy runs in Node on Vercel and reads `process.env.NVIDIA_API_KEY`
#   at runtime, so the key never leaves the server.
#
# Add this on Vercel:
#   Project Settings → Environment Variables → New
#     Key:   NVIDIA_API_KEY
#     Value: nvapi-...your-actual-key...
#     Environments: Production, Preview, Development (check all)
#   Then trigger a redeploy so the function picks it up.
#
# For local dev, run `vercel dev` (not `npm run dev`) so the /api routes work.
# `vercel dev` reads this file automatically.
#
# Get a key at https://build.nvidia.com/explore/discover
NVIDIA_API_KEY=nvapi-your-key-here
